## Adjacent surfaces worth knowing about

- **`/home/cis/windows/realstate/components/locations/location-map.tsx`** — the exact same two-layer pattern you'd want for 3D: server-rendered SVG (`corridor-map.tsx`, ~3KB, real crawlable content) rendered first, then `IntersectionObserver` `rootMargin: "300px"` swaps in `dynamic(ssr:false)` MapLibre. `maplibre-map.tsx` uses OSM public raster tiles and carries a ⚠ comment that `NEXT_PUBLIC_MAP_TILE_URL` must be set before launch.
- **Deferred-import wrappers** — a consistent convention of `deferred-*.tsx` client shims that each hold one `dynamic(..., { ssr: false, loading: <pulse skeleton> })`: `deferred-floor-plans.tsx`, `deferred-brochure.tsx`, `deferred-enquiry-form.tsx`, `deferred-emi-calculator.tsx`. Copy this shape for new 3D blocks.
- **`components/projects/floor-plan-viewer.tsx`** (324 lines) — hand-rolled SVG zoom/pan, `MIN_ZOOM = 1`, `MAX_ZOOM = 3`, wheel + drag + keyboard (`+`/`-`/`0`/arrows), compass rotation from `lib/floor-plans.ts`. A likely candidate to become 3D.
- **Embla** powers `testimonial-carousel.tsx` (77 lines) and `gallery-grid.tsx` (236 lines, lightbox).
- **`components/layout/site-header.tsx`** — passive `scroll` listener flipping `scrolled` at `window.scrollY > 24`; transparent only when `useSelectedLayoutSegment() === null` (home). Any hero change affects this.
- **CSS motion tokens** in `app/globals.css:80-86`: `--ease-entrance: cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)`, `--ease-transition: cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)`, `--animate-duration-micro: 180ms`, `--animate-duration-ui: 300ms`, `--animate-duration-reveal: 500ms`. Keyframes: `fade-in-canvas`, `rise`, `nudge`. Brand colours used in the 3D scenes: `--charcoal #141414`, `--charcoal-2 #1a1a1a`, `--ivory #f5f1e8`, `--gold #b99c6b`, `--bronze #7a5a33`.
- **`next.config.ts` is completely empty** — no `transpilePackages`, no `webpack` loader for GLSL/GLB, no `serverExternalPackages`, no image config. Any shader-file or model-loader work needs config added here.

